  ChatGPT, Codex, Claude Code and DeepSeek Harness connect through their respective adapters. The plugin supplies working guidance, and a connector or MCP reaches the project service. The shared writer saves changes to the open project. Each client requires its supported setup.

  Source: actual HUANDENG Editor v0.18 public example and project feature contracts. https://github.com/JaytonKogeru/huandeng; packages/core/src/pptd/agent-guide.ts; docs/SPEC-V018.md. Screenshot provenance is retained with the project assets.
